	)
	(text "BATTERY SENSE  -  10S pack tap J11, 220k/13k = 17.9x (2.34 V at 42 V, room up to 12S), plus C4 at Pico A's ADC0.  Electronics and winch voltages come from the INA228s (U10, U11)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 279.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "11483872-f0bf-4b77-a272-302685f040e8")
	)
	(text "CAPACITORS  -  100uF 63V bulk on each 10S input; 470uF 35V on the 15 V A4988 supply (C25); 100nF ADC filters. The pack tap filter cap is C4 at Pico A's ADC0 pin; J11 is JST-VH so no signal plug can mate with it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 314.80 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "657928f8-1220-4f03-982e-aa9fb24aa967")
	)
	(text "CONNECTORS  -  JST-XH for signals, JST-VH for the 10S tap (J11) and the 4S backup (J18), XT60 for the 10S inputs; J16 is female (switched output)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 350.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3a34e5a8-dc90-4185-a76f-d4d91444ba44")
	)
	(text "10S INPUTS  -  XT60 (pin 1 = notched end = negative, per the XT60 convention) + in-line Kelvin shunts; the sense pins have their own nets (ELEC/WINCH_SHUNT_P/N).  Both packs share one 10S bus; the drive is sensed off-board: its current never crosses this carrier."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 396.20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "65bf40df-4f63-4dcd-a0f4-b79304f82903")
	)
	(text "WINCH KILL PATH  -  high-side P-FET, fail-safe OFF, feeding the ESC on J16"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 434.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1df169de-43f7-441f-b428-3feef7f0de69")
	)
	(text "DECOUPLING  -  100nF per supply pin; C13 is the BNO085 internal-LDO cap (required)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 472.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5c0010fc-5def-4cdd-b50d-1b079f740fcc")
	)
	(text "RAIL BULK + STEPPER MOTOR BULK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 508.14 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "adfa4f49-cc42-4e7f-bd7b-11f29030fea5")
	)
	(text "I2C PULL-UPS  -  4.7k pair on every used TCA9548A channel (a mux isolates the channels, so the upstream pair does not serve them). CH2 is free: the BMP390 (U6) came off in rev F"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 543.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "33363742-710a-4d08-819b-31d1551f1634")
	)
	(text "POD PCB  -  separate board, here for reference only.  Tether pin 2 carries 15 V from U15 through F1; the pod makes its own 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.00 579.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.2 2.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e0ca0c2c-95f1-4742-abef-6850372ab2d6")
	)
