	(text "TETHER RS-485  (2026-09-25, Pico B since 2026-10-13)  -  half duplex on Pico B's UART0 (TX GP16, RX GP17); GP18 drives DE and ~RE together (high = transmit); R62 holds receive mode through reset; 120R termination at this end of the tether."
