		(property "Description" "Pico A, control MCU: Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350) on two 1x20 sockets under the carrier, C++ (Arduino-Pico or the Pico SDK), USB cable to the Pi. GP0 winch ESC PWM, GP1 SBUS (UART0 RX, invert in the GPIO block), GP2-GP8 A4988 (DIR, STEP, SLEEP, MS3, MS2, MS1, EN), GP9 winch kill (high = winch on), GP10 WS2812 data (PIO, through U12), GP11 5 V power-good, GP14/GP15 CAN RX/TX (can2040 on the PIO, through U3), GP20/GP21 UART1 link to Pico B, GP22 leak excite, ADC0 12S pack, ADC1/ADC2 leak L/R. Its 3V3 pin feeds the board's +3V3 rail (keep the load under 300 mA). VSYS through D10."
			(at 67.31 85.09 0)
			(hide yes)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
