		)
		(property "Description" "Pico B, sensor MCU: Raspberry Pi Pico 2 (RP2350) on two 1x20 sockets under the carrier, C++ (Arduino-Pico or the Pico SDK), USB cable to the Pi. GP4/GP5 GPS (UART1), GP7 INA228 ALERT, GP8/GP9 BNO085 INT/RST, GP10/GP11 link to Pico A (PIO UART), GP12/GP13 I2C0 to the TCA9548A, GP14 mux reset, GP16/GP17 pod RS-485 (UART0, through U13), GP18 RS-485 DE, GP19/GP20 ADXL375 INT1/INT2. Its own 3V3 pin stays unconnected: Pico A's 3V3 feeds the board rail, and two regulator outputs are never tied. VSYS through D11."
			(at 960.12 120.65 0)
			(hide yes)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
