		(property "Description" "Pi resets Pico A: Pi GPIO23 (header pin 16) high turns this on and pulls Pico A's RUN low, in parallel with SW1. R64 holds it off while the Pi is off, booting or out, so Pico A never needs the Pi to run."
			(at 142.24 124.46 0)
			(hide yes)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
