		(property "Description" "+15V from the 10S rail (Pololu D36V6F15, 600 mA, the same part as V3.1's U2): the A4988's motor supply (it takes 8-35 V, under a full 10S pack's 42 V) and, through F1, the pod tether (12-21 V). The pod draws about 0.13 A, so keep the radar stepper under about 0.45 A from this rail with A1's current limit. SHDN is left open, so it's always on."
			(at 279.40 215.90 0)
			(hide yes)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
